},{"day":14,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":15,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":16,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":17,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":18,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":19,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":20,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":21,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":22,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":23,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":24,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":25,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":26,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":27,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":28,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":29,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":30,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":31,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":32,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":33,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":34,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":35,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":36,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":37,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":38,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":39,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":40,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":41,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":42,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":43,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":44,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":45,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":46,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":47,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":48,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":49,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":50,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":51,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":52,"uw":4,"rank":"village"},{"day":53,"uw":4,"rank":"village"},{"day":54,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":55,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":102,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":103,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":104,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":105,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":106,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":107,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":108,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":109,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":110,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":111,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":112,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":113,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":114,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":115,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":116,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":117,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":118,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":119,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":120,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":121,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":122,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":123,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":124,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":125,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":126,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":127,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":128,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":129,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":130,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":131,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":132,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":133,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":134,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":135,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":136,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":137,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":94,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","🐕 It moves.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ THE LOUD BEAST! (4 of them!) Henry, Marvin join you!","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Henry doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\"","The woods go silent — not quiet. Silent. Like the world holding its breath. The pack is already moving. They go quiet before the rush. If the birds stop, they're already moving.","The pack's heads turn as one — toward Marvin. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)","The Loud Beast 3 is on Marvin — no warning, just teeth.","Marvin's gear absorbs 7.","The Loud Beast 3 hits Marvin for 9.","Too close. The wolf 2's attention SNAPS to Henry — proximity overrules patience.","The pack's heads turn as one — toward Marvin. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)","The Loud Beast 2 is on Marvin — no warning, just teeth.","They're coming from both sides — nowhere to turn. (FLANKED +2)","Marvin's gear absorbs 6.","The Loud Beast 2 hits Marvin for 8.","Too close. The wolf 4's attention SNAPS to Henry — proximity overrules patience.","The pack's heads turn as one — toward Marvin. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)","The pack's heads turn as one — toward Marvin. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)","Marvin strikes the Loud Beast 2.","Marvin hits wolf 2 for 6.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Marvin.","Henry runs for it!","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","⚠️ 1 threats: The Loud Beast 1 (×4) — all here, all now.\nYour party: just you. You are outnumbered — fight like it.","You catch fragments by the fire — Nathan telling Boris about Amy. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","Marvin heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Bill heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","Henry heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\"","Boris heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","AMBUSH: first blood. ×1.5.","(wolf 1's hide absorbs 2.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Loud Beast 1 falls.","You STRIKE the wolf 1 for 120 (Hardlight knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Loud Beast 1!","Too close. The wolf 3's attention SNAPS to Marvin — proximity overrules patience.","Marvin strikes the Loud Beast 2.","Marvin hits wolf 2 for 6.","(wolf 2's hide absorbs 2.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Loud Beast 2 falls.","You STRIKE the wolf 2 for 74 (Hardlight knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","📺 +20 style — dropped the Loud Beast 2!","Too close. The wolf 3's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","💥 wolf 3's Harass finds Marvin — no dodging it.","Marvin's gear absorbs 4.","Wolf 3's Harass hits Marvin for 4.","💥 wolf 4's Harass finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 7.","Wolf 4's Harass hits you for 2.","Marvin strikes the Loud Beast 3.","Marvin hits wolf 3 for 8.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Marvin.","(wolf 3's hide absorbs 2.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Loud Beast 3 falls.","You STRIKE the wolf 3 for 79 (Hardlight knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","📺 +20 style — dropped the Loud Beast 3!","💥 wolf 4's Harass finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 4.","Wolf 4's Harass hits you for 2.","Marvin strikes the Loud Beast 4.","Marvin hits wolf 4 for 7.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Marvin.","(wolf 4's hide absorbs 2.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Loud Beast 4 falls.","You STRIKE the wolf 4 for 79 (Hardlight knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","📺 +20 style — dropped the Loud Beast 4!","Henry nods, slow. \"Remind me not to cross you.\"","Edible but lean. The old taboo itches; hunger doesn't care. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","Edible but lean. The old taboo itches; hunger doesn't care. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","Edible but lean. The old taboo itches; hunger doesn't care. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","Edible but lean. The old taboo itches; hunger doesn't care. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","📯 It moves.","💧 Amy returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 Nathan returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 Dmitri returns with water: +3 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","Word with the traders: Emberhold door is clear again. Whatever had them, let go.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Dog tags. Not yours. Miriam's. You carry them so someone is remembered — the promise you made in the dust. Miriam would laugh at you carrying them into the apocalypse. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to meadow.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Rubble chokes the path.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You walk back into Haven. 35 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Marvin returns with water: +2 clean.","🌿 Bill returns from foraging the wilds: +189 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 188 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","🌿 Henry returns from foraging the wilds: +292 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 292 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","💧 Boris returns with water: +4 clean.","🍲 Marvin is eating by the fire — not talking, just eating.","📖 Bill is showing Nathan the Bitter Manioc — where it grows, what's safe to eat.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 900 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Algorithm gorges at the treeline — 881 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","Village meal: +300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Nathan came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)","Henry traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Sanne and Marvin lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Nathan stands in the pantry doorway a moment. \"Look at all this. Tending the fire today — someone ought to keep the stories.\"","🍽️ Bill watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"","Bill spent the afternoon sewing, and the Hide armor came apart in their hands. The bark strips are wasted.","🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","— DAY 94 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Snow by morning. (-8°C — Freezing) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","Marvin Justice reads the sky: clear tomorrow, freezing.","The cold works on everyone — the village wakes aching from the deep cold.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+4 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","👂 Overheard — Dmitri: \"The third incident followed the same interval as the first two. That's not weather.\"","👂 Overheard — Amy: \"Right. Let's do it, then. Talking doesn't chop wood.\"","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","You catch fragments by the fire — Marvin telling Nathan about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","💬 Marvin whispers: \"Someone's been leaving food out, and Wren won't admit a thing. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\"","Amy heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","Nathan heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sanne heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]},{"cls":"herald-refused-late","day":126,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["That night, they bring Boris home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","Village meal: +2200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Hannah gets bound up properly. (36 → 51 HP)","Hannah is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 23/100)","Henry traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","🛟 Amy stands up by the fire. \"People are going down and the tents are filling — we do something or we don't, but we decide. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\"","\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\"","\"Or we rally,\" Amy adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\"","(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)","The northwest ground is thinning faster than your crews alone could strip it. Emberhold isn't slowing down — their foragers are on your turf most days now. Their speaker would probably want words. (Talk about the shared ground at their fire.)","🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,240 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate.","— DAY 126 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 Amy claims to belong somewhere — then spends the whole evening oriented around something they won't name. The wanting is real. The word for it isn't \"to belong somewhere\".","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Shard spear","Plus 42 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","Marvin Justice reads the sky: frost tomorrow, cold.","You wake with a start — something is wrong.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ UGLY-EYES! You're on your own.","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","The anaconda's head swings toward you. You're on the list now — it doesn't forget.","💥 The Ugly-Eyes SNAPS! No warning. There never is.","Armor absorbs 9.","Ugly-Eyes hits you for 5.","(anaconda's hide absorbs 6.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","anaconda is hurt — and it goes quiet and clever. It stops rushing. It starts CHOOSING. Watch the spacing.","You STRIKE the anaconda for 60 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","💥 The Ugly-Eyes SNAPS! No warning. There never is.","Armor absorbs 12.","Ugly-Eyes hits you for 6.","(anaconda's hide absorbs 6.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Ugly-Eyes falls.","You STRIKE the anaconda for 59 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Ugly-Eyes!","A LOT of snake. Tough, rich, faintly fishy — and it feeds the whole village for days. The fat renders beautifully. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","The ring light brightens to noon. The followers lean in, filming.","🤳 It moves.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","You don't know what that was. Someone the light loves. Someone at the haven should hear about this.","⚔ THE INFLUENCER! You're on your own.","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS — a new follower crawls out of the glow, phone-first, already filming. (1 followers. Each one sharpens the Ratio and drinks your favor.)","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","You catch fragments by the fire — Sanne telling Hannah about Amy. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","💧 Dmitri returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 Sanne returns with water: +3 clean.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Riders from Emberhold: something's at THEIR door now. They can't spare anyone — and they wanted Haven to know first.","Too far — 2 squares left.","📱 1 follower turn the audience — care packages thin, the System's favor trickles away. (-1 favor.)","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS before it acts — RATIO incoming, sharpened by 1 followers.","‘This Ratio is brought to you by—’ The followers glow with sponsored light. They hit harder now. (Allied monsters +4 damage, 2 turns.)","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the influencer for 65 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS — a new follower crawls out of the glow, phone-first, already filming. (2 followers. Each one sharpens the Ratio and drinks your favor.)","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the influencer for 73 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 2 followers turn the audience — care packages thin, the System's favor trickles away. (-2 favor.)","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS before it acts — RATIO incoming, sharpened by 2 followers.","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the influencer for 66 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS — a new follower crawls out of the glow, phone-first, already filming. (3 followers. Each one sharpens the Ratio and drinks your favor.)","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","influencer is BLEEDING — and it likes it. Louder, faster, no more feints.","You STRIKE the influencer for 76 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 3 followers turn the audience — care packages thin, the System's favor trickles away. (-3 favor.)","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS before it acts — RATIO incoming, sharpened by 3 followers.","💥 influencer's attack finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 28.","Influencer's attack hits you for 20.","📖 Codex: Ratio — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this.","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the influencer for 76 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS — a new follower crawls out of the glow, phone-first, already filming. (4 followers. Each one sharpens the Ratio and drinks your favor.)","(influencer's hide absorbs 8.)","💪 Your Agility grows — 6. The work is changing you.","✨ Footwork — You move without thinking. (tier 1)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the influencer for 84 (Harvest Scythe).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📱 4 followers turn the audience — care packages thin, the System's favor trickles away. (-4 favor.)","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS before it acts — RATIO incoming, sharpened by 4 followers.","💥 influencer's attack finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 24.","Influencer's attack hits you for 18.","📖 Codex: Callout Post — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this.","Too far — 2 squares left.","📱 4 followers turn the audience — care packages thin, the System's favor trickles away. (-4 favor.)","📱 The ring light BRIGHTENS before it acts — RATIO incoming, sharpened by 4 followers.","💥 influencer's Ratio finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 30.","Influencer's Ratio hits you for 23.","You go down.","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nathan Lee is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.","🕯️ Nathan is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes.","In the chaos, the neglected link snaps — no tribute, no deeds, no one left who kept it. Nobody meant it. That's how these things go.","The link with Emberhold is broken (succession). What was built over weeks comes apart in a sentence.","🕯️ Nathan Lee is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.","What Nathan kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.","\"Nathan's gone.\" Dmitri looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Nathan.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.","The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Marvin blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.","🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"","📖 The Codex turns a page: Nathan Lee, 126 days. The mantle passes to Marvin Justice.","🪞 You wake up somebody else. Marvin Justice, 62 — a taxi driver. Their hands know different work now: Beast-calm, Echo Location, Translator.","You knew Nathan — not the office, the person. The fire keeps expecting him, and so do you. That's a heavier kind of stepping up. (+5 trauma)","At the grave, Amy, Henry, Dmitri and 1 more speak for Marvin — \"Nathan trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.","The fire knew Marvin before the Codex did — their name already carried weight here.","You are full enough.","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (215 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (200 kcal).","Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (200 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (200 kcal).","Unequipped Sling.","📯 It moves.","You catch fragments by the fire — Dmitri telling Hannah about you. The retelling is already better than the event.","💬 Henry says: \"Someone's been leaving food out. Good food. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\"","💧 Amy returns with water: +4 clean.","👥 Dmitri heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","👥 Sanne walks out with Dmitri. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":94,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":66,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":45,"opinion":11,"arrears":9750,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":true,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":67,"opinion":25,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":2},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":51,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":2,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":4,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":94,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":66,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":45,"opinion":11,"arrears":9750,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":true,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":67,"opinion":25,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":2},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":51,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":2,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":2,"outcomesPrior":1,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":2,"day":94,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":66,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":45,"opinion":11,"arrears":9750,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":true,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":67,"opinion":25,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":2},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":51,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":2,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":