,{"day":55,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":102,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":103,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":104,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":105,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":106,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":107,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":108,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":109,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":110,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":89,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate.","— DAY 88 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 Noah was talking about home — then stopped mid-sentence, recalibrated, and said \"Denver\" just a fraction too deliberately. Whatever home is, it isn't where that sentence started.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Unequipped Crossbow.","A sweet smell, suddenly strong. The warts seem to lean toward you.","🍄 It moves.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","⚔ MURKCAP! Caleb joins you!","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Caleb squares up to watch. \"Give it hell.\"","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","💬 Caleb whispers: \"Someone's been leaving food out, and Wren won't admit a thing. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\"","Dieter heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","Caleb heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","💧 Lena returns with water: +3 clean.","🚶 Aki is back with Henry.","💧 Henry returns with water: +2 clean.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Caleb strikes the Murkcap.","Caleb hits cap for 16.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Caleb.","Caleb strikes the Murkcap.","Caleb hits cap for 16.","cap is hurt bad — and it knows it. Wild swings, everything committed, nothing held back. Dangerous and sloppy.","Too close. The cap's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","💥 cap's Cap Slam finds Caleb — no dodging it.","Caleb's gear absorbs 10.","Cap's Cap Slam hits Caleb for 9.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(cap's hide absorbs 1.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the cap for 16.","📺 +5 style — solid hit","Caleb strikes the Murkcap.","Caleb hits cap for 12.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Caleb.","Too close. The cap's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","💥 cap's Cap Slam finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 7.","Cap's Cap Slam hits you for 9.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(cap's hide absorbs 1.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","The Murkcap falls.","You STRIKE the cap for 19.","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Murkcap!","Caleb claps once, slow. \"That's how it's done.\"","Do not eat the monster mushroom. The flesh is ibotenic sponge — the spores alone are a trip you don't come back from.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","No risky water to boil.","📯 It moves.","Drank clean water.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","You catch fragments by the fire — Noah telling Lena about Henry. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","🚶 Noah is back with Fabrizio.","💧 Fabrizio returns with water: +2 clean.","Aki heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 12L left.","📯 It moves.","💧 Dieter returns with water: +4 clean.","Noah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💧 Caleb returns with water: +3 clean.","Henry heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","💬 Lena is with Fabrizio, talking the way people do when nobody else is listening.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. You learned the voice — low, steady, unhurried. 'Panic is just information arriving too fast.' You hear it in your own voice now when it counts. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Dieter telling Henry about himself. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","You catch fragments by the fire — Lena telling Henry about Noah. The retelling is already better than the event.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 9× Muscadine Grapes (810 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (810 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 35 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 6 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","⬆️ Green Thumb, Literally deepened to L2! +100% yield (was +50%).","\"We didn't even explain that part! You figured it out yourself! That's the good stuff! The gamblers are thrilled!\"","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","Taken: Teeth x3, Stripped hide x1.","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","⬢ SYSTEM: \"You have built the body. The crown is ours to give.\"","✨ CAPSTONE: Seed Vault. Every seed you have ever pocketed, kept dry and dreaming. It weighs almost nothing. Almost. It was never going to drop from a monster. It was always going to be GIVEN — to someone who'd earned the shape of it.","📓 Codex: The System granted you the Seed Vault — a finished The Living Garden build recognized.","Everything stops. Not all at once — conversations trail off, a dropped spoon rings too loud. The night does something it has never done. Every face turns toward you.","Aki: \"I saw it happen. I was THERE.\"\nDieter: \"We all felt it. Like the air changed its mind.\"","The soil near you is warm. Things are growing that you didn't plant. Look at your hands. Look at what the light does around you now. You are The Living Garden — Blooming, Grown-Over. A figure half-lost in vines and blossoms — green-gold, flowers opening along the shoulders, roots at the feet. The garden, walking.","Godhood demands its price, and the price is not hidden: Once per day. It costs you 200 kcal of your own — the garden gives, but through you. You're not a fighter. Your garden needs guards, and everyone knows it.","✨ Ability gained: Cornucopia (L1). Successful plant gathers build +15% yield each, up to +150%. Walking between patches keeps the chain; a failed gather, other work, combat or a night's rest breaks it. Cultivated beds: your paid cultivation increases the next harvest by another 25%/50%/75% at levels 1/2/3.","\"THE BASKET OVERFLOWS. THE BASKET HAS ALWAYS OVERFLOWED. YOU JUST FINALLY NOTICED.\"","\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\"","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","You catch fragments by the fire — Noah telling Lena about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","You catch fragments by the fire — Dieter telling Noah about themself. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","💧 Aki returns with water: +4 clean.","◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 600 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Eulogy gorges at the treeline — 1,400 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","A stranger at the tree line, watching. Not hiding, exactly. Measuring. They'll be gone by dusk — but they'll remember what they saw.","That night, they bring Tariq home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +2200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","The fire is quiet today. Nobody's talking much.","Lena: \"The saw palmetto patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\"","Fabrizio and Dieter lingered over the fire together.","Lena and Caleb lingered over the fire together.","Lena and Caleb lingered over the fire together.","Aki and Caleb lingered over the fire together.","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","⚠️ Word of a raid reaches the trail — Henry turns back for Haven.","— DAY 89 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, White Oak Acorns (in shell) went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","📦 Your showbiz fans voted: a wacky curio, gift-wrapped, no note. The note would have explained it. There is no note.","🏃 Ben of Stonebridge walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Stonebridge has grain to spare — 2,534 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\"","(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)","Dawn. You wake rested. (+9 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","You catch fragments by the fire — Noah telling Henry about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater.","You catch fragments by the fire — Henry telling Noah about themself. It's picking up decorations as it travels.","Dieter heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","💧 Noah returns with water: +3 clean.","Caleb heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","Aki heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\"","💧 Henry returns with water: +4 clean.","Fabrizio is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in.","Lena is tending the fire, coaxing it steady.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📯 It moves.","Noah heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","Fabrizio is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in.","Lena is tending the fire, coaxing it steady.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":89,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":73,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":92,"opinion":39,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":4,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":4},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":96,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":6,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":87,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":10,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":16,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":3,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":89,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":73,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":92,"opinion":39,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":4,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":4},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":96,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":6,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":87,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":10,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":16,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":3,"outcomesPrior":1,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0