day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":95,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["💧 Zoltan returns with water: +3 clean.","🩹 Ernestine is hurting (15 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (15 → 40 HP)","👥 Ernestine heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Nia walks out with Ernestine. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","Zoltan heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","It followed you. The Sweeps Week is here.","Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","It followed you. The Sweeps Week is here.","One down — but 3 still hold the treeline. The gorge goes on.","Still full. (Eat, test a lump, or leave some.)","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","⚔️ Ernestine stared down the Sweeps Week and it backed off — 0 rounds, not a scratch on them. It's still out there, somewhere.","You walk back into Haven. 52 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Ernestine is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.","📖 The entry for Ernestine is finished. No more pages.","You coax 1 growing bed forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","Your pack is full (21.6 kg of 20 kg) — 70× Blackberry (7 kg, 4550 kcal) goes straight to the pantry instead.","🫂 It moves.","You are full enough.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Bark armor x1, Hunting spear x1, Snare wire x1.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","🚶 Nia is back.","💧 Chloe returns with water: +2 clean.","🚶 Jesse is back with Chloe.","🌙 Night. The lingering Sweeps Week gorges at the treeline — 1,000 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 845 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Loud-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 975 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🗣️ Zoltan to Nia, by the fire: \"It eats while we deliberate. The Herald feeds on our stores and we're supposed to just... wait?\"","Someone walks in like they belong here, grinning. \"Heard about this place three valleys over. Had to see it.\" The System's show has an audience, and audiences talk.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started.","⚠ DEHYDRATED: find and treat water today.","Village meal: +2210 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🍽️ Nia surveys the stacked shelves and nods. \"The wild can rest. Splitting firewood instead — winter comes whether we like it or not.\"","🍽️ Zoltan leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\"","🌿 Tamarind, weeks in the baskets. Handling it day after day, the village has learned what it's FOR — not just what it is. The village knows its uses now.","💡 Tamarind: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click.","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","— DAY 94 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Whatever was at the door has moved on — or found easier meat. The call goes quiet.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Chloe left 2 bark strips by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","👥 Chloe heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","👥 Jesse walks out with Chloe. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","💧 Zoltan returns with water: +3 clean.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","Zoltan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","You catch fragments by the fire — Lena telling Zoltan about Nia. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","Nia heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","It followed you. The Sweeps Week is here.","Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","Still full. (Eat, test a lump, or leave some.)","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","💀 The Ugly-Eyes killed Ernestine in 1 round. The village mourns.","You walk back into Haven. 52 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 1 growing bed forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Bark armor x1, Hunting spear x1, Snare wire x1.","You are full enough.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","Too heavy. Carrying 21.6/20 kg.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Chloe returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 Jesse is back with Chloe.","💧 Zoltan returns with water: +2 clean.","Zoltan is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot.","A curious wanderer grins wide. Haven grows by one.","👋 The village didn't wait for you — a curious wanderer was taken in around the fire. Another pair of hands.","🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (Loud-Eyes, The Herald, Big Big) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall.","🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — Loud-Eyes came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind.","🚨 Loud-Eyes, The Herald, Big Big is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs.","👥 The Reunion watches Heinrich — learning their moves.","Nobody met The Herald — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met Big Big — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","🛡️ Heinrich met them at the door — 1 barely walked away. Heinrich is hurt.","The watch holds the wall. You sleep through the worst of it — or would have, if the shouting had let you.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started.","⚠ DEHYDRATED: find and treat water today.","Village meal: +2320 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🩹 You make rounds — Heinrich gets bound up properly. (25 → 40 HP)","Heinrich came back with 315 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes.","Heinrich is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 23/100)","Lena and Jesse lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Zoltan counts the pantry jars twice, then sets down the gathering sack. \"We're eating well. Sharpening the skinning knives instead.\"","🍽️ Jesse looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"","💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back.","— DAY 95 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there.","\"The System flagged your sector. Move. NOW.\"","(218 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Ghost Camo","Plus 40 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","You wake with a start — something is wrong.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","You catch fragments by the fire — Lena telling Chloe about Zoltan. The retelling is already better than the event.","💬 Zoltan mutters: \"Found a parcel by the hollow. Dried meat, clean water. That has Wren written all over it.\"","💧 Nia returns with water: +4 clean.","👥 Chloe sets out to find Nia. \"Won't be long.\"","👥 Jesse walks out with Chloe. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","👥 Nia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Zoltan walks out with Nia. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Your pack is full — water is heavy (1L = 1kg). Drink some or drop weight before filling.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":95,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":67,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":80,"opinion":46,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":83,"opinion":54,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":59,"opinion":54,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":7,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":2}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":8,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":2,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":95,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":67,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":80,"opinion":46,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":83,"opinion":54,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":9,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":59,"opinion":54,"arrears"