},{"day":55,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":86,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Coat button. The last winter before the scattering. You don't talk about it. The button remembers the weight of that coat, the cold that got in anyway, and who was wearing it. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","Something pads into the clearing — The Mountain Lord. It's here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","The Mountain Lord stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Influencer stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You walk back into Haven. 51 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,299 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Aisha clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Max returns with water: +4 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","— DAY 84 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands.","Snow by morning. (-8°C — Freezing) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","The cold works on everyone — the village wakes aching from the deep cold.","🎁 Aisha of Stonebridge walks in with pack-mules and full baskets: 2,299 kcal, into Haven's bins — real pieces, honestly counted. \"Eat. We'll settle the books when the green comes back.\"","Your stomach is a fist. Eat — anything real, now.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 498 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)","You are full enough.","Took Aid from Stonebridge.","You eat Aid from Stonebridge (500 kcal).","Took Aid from Stonebridge.","You eat Aid from Stonebridge (500 kcal).","Took Aid from Stonebridge.","You eat Aid from Stonebridge (500 kcal).","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 0L left.","Max heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Coat button. The last winter before the scattering. You don't talk about it. The button remembers the weight of that coat, the cold that got in anyway, and who was wearing it. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 4× Purslane, 3× Cattail (480 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (480 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 51 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You sow Purslane: 30 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 28 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Purslane: 30 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 28 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning.","💧 Max returns with water: +2 clean.","🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 2,110 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire.","🌾 Tribute from Stonebridge arrives — 2,110 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire.","🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)","🧳 Word from Emberhold: traders say Emberhold had a new speaker — or so the traders say","📡 The world feed: Stonebridge — a monster sighting. The chat has opinions.","Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade.","Max came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there.","Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else.","Back at the haven the argument starts: Max is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want.","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","Village meal: +2019 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","🍽️ Someone looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"","✦ Max has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)","✦ Max has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)","💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back.","The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning.","— DAY 85 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there.","\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\"","(227 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Coat button. The last winter before the scattering. You don't talk about it. The button remembers the weight of that coat, the cold that got in anyway, and who was wearing it. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to trail edge.","💬 Elijah whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\"","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to meadow.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","A sturdy stick (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 8× Hickory Nuts, 6× Burdock (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Influencer stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (900 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You walk back into Haven. 51 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Cattail: 90 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 30 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","Max heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","🧳 A traveler passed through yesterday, talking about a village to the southeast called The Hungry Road. The region is bigger than your fire.","🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Influencer, The Herald, The Algorithm) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! The palisade's stakes take their toll as they come over the wall.","🐗⚠️ One of them is bigger than the usual teeth at the door — The Influencer came with this raid, and the wall was not built for its kind.","🚨 The Influencer, The Herald, The Algorithm is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs.","Nobody met The Influencer — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met The Herald — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","Nobody met The Algorithm — it's still out there at the treeline. It'll gorge every night until it's driven off.","The watch holds the wall. You sleep through the worst of it — or would have, if the shouting had let you.","⚠️ Word that raiders are on the move (3 of them) reaches the trail — Max turns back for Haven.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","Village meal: +2300 kcal from the communal pantry.","— DAY 86 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Snow by morning. (-8°C — Freezing) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","The cold works on everyone — the village wakes aching from the deep cold.","Something has shifted. Conversations stop when you approach the fire. Nobody meets your eyes for long.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","💧 Max returns with water: +2 clean.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 1L left.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","📯 It moves.","Max heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":86,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":72,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":60,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":72,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":7,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":53,"opinion":6,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":5,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":2}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":8,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":0,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":86,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":72,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":60,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":72,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":7,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust