bal"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":102,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":103,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":104,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":105,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":106,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":107,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":108,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":109,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":110,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":111,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":112,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":113,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":114,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":115,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":116,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":117,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":118,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":119,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":120,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":121,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":122,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":123,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":124,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":125,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":126,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":127,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":128,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":129,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":130,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":131,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":132,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":133,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":134,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":135,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":136,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":137,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":138,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":139,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":140,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":141,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":142,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":143,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":144,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":145,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":146,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":147,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":148,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":149,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":150,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":151,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":152,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":153,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":154,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":155,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":156,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":74,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Burdock: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You eat Burdock (630 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (500 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (1 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (425 kcal).","Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning.","📋 Farid — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part.","\"OUR STORY BEGINS,\" says the dark, \"at the end.\"","\"AND THEN THEY RAN.\" The spotlight narrows. The story is gaining weight.","🌱 Ruth works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet.","💧 Farid returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it.","You catch fragments by the fire — Farid telling Ruth about herself. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","💧 Sam returns with water: +2 clean.","🥣 Tariq of The Red Table walks into your firelight alone, thinner than you remember. \"Our jars are empty,\" they say. No preamble. \"I'm asking for food.\"","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 0 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Loud-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 0 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","★ IDENTIFIED: Water Chestnut. Spiky grass in the shallows. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves.","Nikos was watching. Now they know Water Chestnut too.","📚 Village knowledge: Farid taught everyone about Water Chestnut. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger.","Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain.","⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins.","No food in the pantry. The village is hungry. You still get your 1L water.","🩹 You make rounds — Farid gets bound up properly. (39 → 54 HP)","Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Naran goes to sit with them.","★ IDENTIFIED (maybe): Chinese Chestnut. Farid is sure — \"Chinese Chestnut, see the leaves?\" — and you have no reason to doubt them. Yet.","📓 Codex: Farid taught me Chinese Chestnut (fireside).","Farid passes Water Chestnut around the fire — calling it \"Chinese Chestnut\" like they've always known. The others nod along, and just like that the wrong name is loose in the village.","Ruth traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Nikos and Sam lingered over the fire together.","⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 2 of hunger.","🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","— DAY 73 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Chinese Chestnut — named and noted.","Your stomach is a fist. Eat — anything real, now.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU!\"","Inside: Wrong bandage","Plus 57 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","You are full enough.","Took Winner's share (alien rations).","You eat Winner's share (alien rations) (300 kcal).","Took Winner's share (alien rations).","You eat Winner's share (alien rations) (300 kcal).","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Farid hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)","🌱 Ruth works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet.","You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Ruth about Sam. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","🌿 Naran returns from foraging the wilds: +337 kcal to the pantry.","🩹 Ruth is hurting (67 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (67 → 92 HP)","Ruth heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","Farid is tending the fire, coaxing it steady.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (337 kcal).","📋 Farid — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part.","📯 It moves.","💧 Farid returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it.","You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Nikos about you. The retelling is already better than the event.","💬 Mia says: \"Do you think they're watching right now? The... audience? I try not to think about it.\"","Naran heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. You learned the voice — low, steady, unhurried. 'Panic is just information arriving too fast.' You hear it in your own voice now when it counts. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","📖 Farid contradicts the story — a verse restored (5 remain, 1/3 true contradictions).","📖 The Eulogy narrates: \"Farid faltered.\" (5 verses remain.)","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Farid is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.","📖 The entry for Farid is finished. No more pages.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to creek.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","💀 The Loud-Eyes killed Farid in 1 round. The village mourns.","You walk back into Haven. 53 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","✨ Ability gained: Rally Aura (L1). People stand straighter near you. Allies who start a fight within 3 tiles of you start it emboldened (+4 damage for 2 rounds) and holding the line.","\"You don't give speeches. You just stand there and people decide to be braver.\"","\"The REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\"","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","🩹 Nikos is hurting (69 HP) — You patch them up before they head out. (69 → 94 HP)","Nikos heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\"","🌿 Ruth returns from foraging the wilds: +242 kcal to the pantry.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should.","You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Nikos about himself. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean.","Naran is down by the firepit, nudging coals back into the middle.","🧳 Word from The Hungry Road: Talia was killed — Ruth did it, they say. (The truth: dead is dead; the killing part is gossip.)","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 242 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Loud-Eyes gorges at the treeline — 0 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","No food in the pantry. The village is hungry. You still get your 1L water.","🩹 You make rounds — Sam gets bound up properly. (66 → 81 HP)","Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Sam goes to sit with them.","Ruth had the day of their life — 2179 kcal. Two days of food from one person.","🔍 Ruth has been turning over grass-like leaves with a sharp familiar smell when crushed for days — today it clicked. \"I know this one now. Look — see the leaves?\"","Ruth came back with 575 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes.","Sam and Naran lingered over the fire together.","Ruth and Naran lingered over the fire together.","Haven eats again. The hollow look fades.","🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate.","— DAY 74 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Your stomach is a fist. Eat — anything real, now.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+27 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 625 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)","You are full enough.","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (500 kcal).","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (500 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (500 kcal).","Took Foraged food.","You eat Foraged food (500 kcal).","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","🌱 Ruth works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet.","Sam heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\"","🌿 Nikos returns from foraging the wilds: +447 kcal to the pantry.","Ruth heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Something has shifted. Conversations stop when you approach the fire. Nobody meets your eyes for long.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Naran left 3 wood logs by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","📯 It moves.","Naran heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 17L left.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":74,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":64,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold"