GS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","congregation is BLEEDING — and it likes it. Louder, faster, no more feints.","You STRIKE the congregation for 54 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 53 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 53 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","💥 Absolution!","Armor absorbs 43.","Congregation's Absolution hits you for 24.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 51 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 61 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 59 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(congregation's hide absorbs 10.)","💪 Your Strength grows — 7. The work is changing you.","💪 Your Agility grows — 7. The work is changing you.","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the congregation for 55 (Hunting spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","💥 The light hits!","Armor absorbs 35.","Congregation's attack hits you for 20.","📖 Codex: Excommunication — fires in a straight line from itself. You won't forget this.","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","💥 Excommunication!","You're not where it landed. Clean dodge.","📺 +15 style — dodged the Excommunication!","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","🔔 The steeple RINGS — one clear note. The chapel doors swing wide. \"Come. Be washed. Trauma, grief, the whole weight — laid down. The price is obedience, a little geas, nothing you'd miss.\" (Accept: heal 40 + cleanse. Refuse: no leash, but no washing.)","🔔 The steeple RINGS — the bell is the telegraph. ABSOLUTION falls like a beam.","💥 Absolution!","Armor absorbs 45.","Congregation's Absolution hits you for 25.","You go down.","◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Dastan — Combat 1. Three offers; they took Berserker Rage. Earned, chosen. (rage: villager level-up)","📓 Codex: Dastan chose Berserker Rage (rage) at Combat 1.","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Elif Demir is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.","🕯️ Elif is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes.","Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 950 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.","🕯️ Elif Demir is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.","What Elif kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.","\"Elif's gone.\" Ines looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Elif.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.","The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Stan blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.","📖 LEARNED: Tainted Bait (Level 1). Your bait is tainted — traps catch 50% more. (The poison’s in the bait, not your hands. Mostly.)","📖 LEARNED: Wire Snares (Level 1). A loop of wire on a game trail. Simple, effective, ancient. Check at dawn.","📖 LEARNED: Tripwire (Level 1). You string a wire at ankle height. The next monster that moves eats dirt — prone, stunned, and embarrassed. (Sets up the party.)","🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"","📖 The Codex turns a page: Elif Demir, 170 days. The mantle passes to Stan Kowalski.","🪞 You wake up somebody else. Stan Kowalski, 47 — an exterminator. His hands know different work now: Night Eyes, Lucky Rock, Trophy Room.","◈ The System updates its file: the new bearer <redacted> \"Stalker of the Apex Predator.\" It had a word for this one before the Codex came.","The village's quarrel was with Elif — and Elif is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.","You knew Elif — not the office, the person. The fire keeps expecting her, and so do you. That's a heavier kind of stepping up. (+5 trauma)","At the grave, Emma, Ines, Lena speak for Stan — \"Elif trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.","The fire knew Stan before the Codex did — his name already carried weight here.","You are full enough.","Took Tribute grain from Emberhold.","You eat Tribute grain from Emberhold (500 kcal).","Took Tribute grain from Emberhold.","You eat Tribute grain from Emberhold (500 kcal).","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","The water bulges. Something big just decided you might be food.","The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline.","You don't know what that was. Two knobs on glass-still water, watching. Someone at the haven should hear about this.","⚔ CLIFFHANGER! Dastan, Ines, Lena join you!","Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act.","Ines doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\"","🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.","(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")","Ines heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","Lena heads out to check the snares. \"Wire doesn't lie.\"","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","Ines strikes the Cliffhanger.","Ines hits mugger for 29.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Ines.","Too close. The mugger's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience.","Dastan strikes the Cliffhanger.","Dastan hits mugger for 13.","mugger is BLEEDING — and it likes it. Louder, faster, no more feints.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Dastan.","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","(mugger's hide absorbs 3.)","OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel.","You STRIKE the mugger for 28 (Stone knife).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on you.","Ines strikes the Cliffhanger.","Ines hits mugger for 29.","The Cliffhanger falls.","It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Ines.","Dastan nods, slow. \"Remind me not to cross you.\"","White meat, firm like fish. The tail is the prize cut — smoke it. It's dead. The carcass is there on the ground — search the body if you want the meat. But you don't know this flesh. Clean it, test it cautiously, or ask someone who knows. And don't leave it long: meat rots where it lies.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","📖 LEARNED: Dead Aim (Level 1). First attack in any combat is a guaranteed critical if you waited 1 round. Patience, then thunder.","📈 Combat 2: the work taught you Dead Aim.","◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Lena — Combat 1. Three offers; they took Berserker Rage. Earned, chosen. (rage: villager level-up)","📓 Codex: Lena chose Berserker Rage (rage) at Combat 1.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":170,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":137,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":80,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":80,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":85,"opinion":46,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":8,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":6,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":1,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":170,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"nee